 "description": "Run a function an app declares (manifest.functions) \u2014 data in, data out, no UI needed. The body is code the app's author wrote and it may make outbound network requests (a host may route them through an allowlisted gateway). Args are checked against the declared params; failures return the declared schema so the retry needs no extra read. The reply carries the return value plus a receipt per write.",
